Studio Price
- We need to change hourly rate to daily rate, studios do not work in hourly rate
- Studios also can choose not to display the exact rate but in absense of that, we put one $ for a cheap studio, $$ for mid tier , $$$ for exspensive. Please do some research on what rate is a cheap studio
- Currently we do everything in dollars but when a studio should set their currency. Quotes and rates would be made in this currency maiking the platform worldwide.

More Roles
- Currently we only have Creators and Owners as public roles (Admin is a special role that only a few hold)
- We need to add the following roles to the site:
    - A&R
    - Engineer
    - Manager
- We need to change the view of a the Creator to not only Musicians but also Podcasters, Voice Actors etc.
- The aim of this refactor is that we shouldnt exclude any people who need a studio to do their work.

Dont Force Log In
 - The site should be able to be used without an account
 - The anon user to should see the view of a creator, if they try to perform any actions which require to be logged in like sending a quotes from a quote baket they should be taken to login. We should hook people on the site before forcing them to log in which may cause friction in the research stage.

Profiles
- We want the primary pull to stwd.io to be that its a platform which connects all the dots which go into creation of music, podcasts, audiobooks, voice acting etc
- We need to introduce the ability to view users profiles
- The user should be able to have a dedicated profile section like LinkedIn/Facebook/Instagram for studios
    - They can set their profile picture
    - Their about section, like a blurb with a char limit
    - They can link their social medias
        - Instagram
        - X
    - They can link their creations
        - Eg:
            - Musicians could link their Spotify / SoundCloud and list upcoming gigs
            - Engineers could link their Discogs to show their work
            - etc - these are just examples for the above roles and for other roles work it out with logic and research
    - Users can follow other users
    - Would show their follower accounts on their profile
    - In the future we could use APIs/Widgets to connect to Spotify, Soundcloud etc to make the data rich but we need to be cautious on cost as this a POC startup
- Think about how powerful and cool this could be, there is no platform out there that connect every single person of a creation who is needed to create audio based art.
- Now that there isnt just studios on the profiles users can find:
    - Studios
    - Artists
    - Engineers
    - A&Rs
    - Managers
    - etc
        - So instead of there just being a Browse section with studios, that would be one section called "Studios" in the sidebar
        - There would then be sections in the sidebar like Artists, Engineers etc. Artists could find their next Manager, Studio owners could find a new engineer etc

User Settings
- The user should be able to set settings like (partially done already)
    - First/Second Name
    - Username
    - Email
    - Reset Password

Please think about these feature/refactors and fill in the blanks where you need or you think I missed opportunities. Use other popular platforms as inspiration.
We have taken inspiration from mybuilder which we still can but we are making the platform rich and should look to other platforms to make out platform unique.

Understand these feature/refactors and return them as individual tasks. Order them by size of effort.